<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Retrieval-Augmented</span></span>
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">(<a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2 Retrieval-Augmented Prompting ‣ 3 Personalized Prompting ‣ A Survey of Personalized Large Language Models: Progress and Future Directions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section 3.2</span></a>)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Soft-Fused</span></span>
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.4.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">(<a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Soft-Fused Prompting ‣ 3 Personalized Prompting ‣ A Survey of Personalized Large Language Models: Progress and Future Directions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section 3.3</span></a>)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:113.8pt;">
