<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Notation Summary</h2>

<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Notation summary used throughout the paper. Symbols are grouped into <span id="A1.T8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Spaces</span>, <span id="A1.T8.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Functions</span>, <span id="A1.T8.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Models</span>, <span id="A1.T8.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Operations</span>, and <span id="A1.T8.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Variables</span>. This table consolidates symbols from the survey.</figcaption>
